### GET request to example server
GET https://examples.http-client.intellij.net/get
    ?generated-in=IntelliJ IDEA

###

### 1. Register
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "sarvesh",
  "email": "test@test.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 2. Login (copy the token from response)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "sarvesh",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 3. Search movies
GET http://localhost:8080/api/movies/search?query=batman

### 4. Add to wishlist (paste token below)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/wishlist
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJzYXJ2ZXNoIiwiaWF0IjoxNzg4MjA2MDM2LCJleHAiOjE3ODgyOTI0MzZ9.V3wADUCVX0AJP0ntbnbvwpjGKMjGSKRce-2CWmEJkPE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "imdbId": "tt0372784",
  "title": "Batman Begins",
  "posterUrl": "https://..."
}

### 5. Get wishlist
GET http://localhost:8080/api/wishlist
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJzYXJ2ZXNoIiwiaWF0IjoxNzg4MjA2MDM2LCJleHAiOjE3ODgyOTI0MzZ9.V3wADUCVX0AJP0ntbnbvwpjGKMjGSKRce-2CWmEJkPE